======== 4. network policy (default deny; each service admits only its callers)
| from                      | to                        | result    |
|---------------------------|---------------------------|-----------|
| an unlabelled pod         | tickets:8104 (front door) | CONNECTED |
| an unlabelled pod         | gateway:8102              | BLOCKED   |
| an unlabelled pod         | knowledge:8103            | BLOCKED   |
| a pod labelled as tickets | gateway:8102              | CONNECTED |
  (labels are not identity: anyone who can create pods in the namespace can claim a label; that is what RBAC is for)
(the cluster is kept; events under load are in phase5_events.py; `kind delete cluster --name ai-lab` removes it)
